+`docs/plan/16-what-we-change.md`): W52-dsa-1, -3, -4 → D-16.1230; W52-dsa-2 → D-16.1231;
+W52-dsa-5, -6, -7 → D-16.1232; W52-dsa-8, -9, -11 → D-16.1233; W52-dsa-10 → D-16.1234;
